<title>USA: CellularVision USA names president, COO.</title>
<headline>CellularVision USA names president, COO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>CellularVision USA said Monday it has named Patrick Greaney president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>The company said Greaney, formerly senior vice president and a member of the executive management committee with Philips Electronics NV's Philips Electronics North America Corp unit, has also been appointed a director of CellularVision.</p>
<p>A company spokesman was not available to confirm whom Greaney is replacing as president and chief operating officer.</p>
</text>
